- Māori 
He taonga tuku iho te ahurea

This chapter is a tribute to the strength, pride, and identity of Māori culture. Through movement, haka, waiata, and whakapapa, we wanted to create something that celebrates the people, not just the performance.

Ngā mihi nui to everyone who welcomed us, shared your time, your knowledge, and your trust. This film exists because of you.
